  "description_short": "Family-run deli and restaurant in Storms River serving home-style meals, local gifts, and takeaway favourites.",
  "description_long": "Tucked along Darnell Street in Storms River village, Arias Boutique Family Restaurant combines a casual dining space with a deli counter and gift shop. The menu covers breakfast basics, burgers, and a rotating selection of home-cooked meals that suit families stopping through the area. You'll find local preserves, craft items, and travel essentials alongside the food offering.\n\nThe relaxed setup works well for travellers needing a quick bite or takeaway before heading into Tsitsikamma. Portions are generous and the kitchen accommodates straightforward requests. It's the kind of spot where function trumps fuss—helpful when you're provisioning for a hiking trip or need a meal between adventures. Service is family-style and the vibe stays low-key, reflecting the quiet rhythm of Storms River itself.",
